  "description": "Just when Zena Lee was finally ready to debut as a K-pop idol, her group was scrapped because of backlash from a scandal involving Siu Ju, former member of another girl group under the same entertainment company. But after a mysterious person named \"T\" contacts Zena, she now sees game holograms that say her only hope of debuting is to appear on a survival idol program called \"To Be Dol\" with none other than Siu. As they face one mystery after another, how will Zena and Siu ever debut together? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
